{"seq":2,"slug":"lazy-initialization","title":"延迟初始化与按需加载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/startup-optimization/lazy-initialization","wordCount":1077,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"延迟初始化与按需加载\">延迟初始化与按需加载</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>延迟初始化（Lazy Initialization）是冷启动优化中收益最显著的手段之一。核心思想是将启动路径上非首屏必需的工作延后执行——不是不做，而是在合适的时机再做。按需加载（On-demand Loading）则进一步将模块的加载时机推迟到用户真正触发时。两者结合可以将启动路径缩减到最小必要集，实测可降低 30-50% 的启动耗时。</p>\n<p>实现延迟初始化需要解决三个核心问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>依赖关系分析</strong>：哪些初始化有先后依赖？哪些可以并行？</li>\n<li><strong>时机选择</strong>：何时执行延迟任务？idle 时、首帧后、还是用户触发时？</li>\n<li><strong>安全保障</strong>：延迟后是否会导致首次使用时卡顿（首次惩罚）？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"启动任务分级模型\">启动任务分级模型</h3><p>将所有启动任务按优先级分为四个等级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>执行时机</th>\n<th>典型任务</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P0</td>\n<td>启动阻塞型</td>\n<td>main 之前或首帧前同步执行</td>\n<td>Crash SDK、安全校验、基础网络配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P1</td>\n<td>首屏依赖型</td>\n<td>首帧渲染前异步并行</td>\n<td>首页数据预取、AB 实验配置、用户态恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P2</td>\n<td>功能就绪型</td>\n<td>首帧后 idle 时执行</td>\n<td>推送注册、IM 长连接、埋点 SDK</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P3</td>\n<td>触发加载型</td>\n<td>用户主动触发时</td>\n<td>直播 SDK、支付模块、分享组件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"任务编排框架设计\">任务编排框架设计</h3><p>一个生产级的启动任务编排框架需要支持：依赖声明、优先级调度、并行执行、超时控制和耗时统计。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[任务注册中心] --&gt; B{依赖关系解析}&#10;    B --&gt; C[拓扑排序]&#10;    C --&gt; D[生成执行计划]&#10;    D --&gt; E[P0 同步执行]&#10;    E --&gt; F[P1 并行执行]&#10;    F --&gt; G[首帧渲染]&#10;    G --&gt; H[P2 idle 调度]&#10;    H --&gt; I[P3 按需触发]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; J[超时监控]&#10;    J --&gt; K[降级策略]\">flowchart TD\n    A[任务注册中心] --&gt; B{依赖关系解析}\n    B --&gt; C[拓扑排序]\n    C --&gt; D[生成执行计划]\n    D --&gt; E[P0 同步执行]\n    E --&gt; F[P1 并行执行]\n    F --&gt; G[首帧渲染]\n    G --&gt; H[P2 idle 调度]\n    H --&gt; I[P3 按需触发]\n\n    D --&gt; J[超时监控]\n    J --&gt; K[降级策略]</pre><p><strong>iOS 实现要点</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 任务定义协议&#10;protocol LaunchTask {&#10;    var name: String { get }&#10;    var priority: TaskPriority { get }&#10;    var dependencies: [String] { get }&#10;    func execute(completion: @escaping () -&gt; Void)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 调度器利用 OperationQueue 管理依赖&#10;class LaunchScheduler {&#10;    private let queue = OperationQueue()&#10;&#10;    func schedule(tasks: [LaunchTask]) {&#10;        let operations = tasks.map { TaskOperation(task: $0) }&#10;        // 建立依赖关系&#10;        for op in operations {&#10;            for dep in op.task.dependencies {&#10;                if let depOp = operations.first(where: { $0.task.name == dep }) {&#10;                    op.addDependency(depOp)&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        queue.addOperations(operations, waitUntilFinished: false)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 任务定义协议</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LaunchTask</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> priority: TaskPriority { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dependencies: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">completion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@escaping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 调度器利用 OperationQueue 管理依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LaunchScheduler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> OperationQueue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> schedule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tasks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [LaunchTask]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> operations </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tasks.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TaskOperation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 建立依赖关系</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> op </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> operations {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dep </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> op.task.dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depOp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> operations.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">first</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.task.name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dep }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    op.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">addDependency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(depOp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        queue.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">addOperations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(operations, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">waitUntilFinished</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Android 实现要点</strong>：</p>\n<p>Google App Startup 库提供了声明式的初始化依赖管理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class AnalyticsInitializer : Initializer&lt;Analytics&gt; {&#10;    override fun create(context: Context): Analytics {&#10;        return Analytics.init(context)&#10;    }&#10;    override fun dependencies(): List&lt;Class&lt;out Initializer&lt;*&gt;&gt;&gt; {&#10;        return listOf(NetworkInitializer::class.java)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class AnalyticsInitializer : Initializer&#x3C;Analytics> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun create(context: Context): Analytics {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Analytics.init(context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun dependencies(): List&#x3C;Class&#x3C;out Initializer&#x3C;*>>> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return listOf(NetworkInitializer::class.java)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于更复杂的场景，可以自研任务编排框架，核心是基于 DAG（有向无环图）的拓扑排序调度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"延迟加载的具体模式\">延迟加载的具体模式</h3><p><strong>模式一：首帧后 idle 加载</strong></p>\n<p>iOS 利用 RunLoop 的 idle 状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"CFRunLoopPerformBlock(CFRunLoopGetMain(), CFRunLoopMode.defaultMode.rawValue) {&#10;    // 首帧后 RunLoop idle 时执行&#10;    PushSDK.shared.register()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CFRunLoopPerformBlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CFRunLoopGetMain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), CFRunLoopMode.defaultMode.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rawValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 首帧后 RunLoop idle 时执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    PushSDK.shared.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Android 利用 IdleHandler：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"Looper.myQueue().addIdleHandler {&#10;    // 主线程空闲时执行&#10;    PushManager.init(context)&#10;    false // 返回 false 表示只执行一次&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Looper.myQueue().addIdleHandler {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 主线程空闲时执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    PushManager.init(context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    false // 返回 false 表示只执行一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>模式二：路由触发懒加载</strong></p>\n<p>将非核心功能模块注册为路由节点，真正跳转时才加载：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"Router.register(&quot;/live/room&quot;) { params in&#10;    // 此时才初始化直播 SDK&#10;    LiveSDK.shared.setup()&#10;    let vc = LiveRoomViewController(roomId: params[&quot;id&quot;])&#10;    return vc&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Router.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/live/room\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { params </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 此时才初始化直播 SDK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    LiveSDK.shared.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">setup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LiveRoomViewController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">roomId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: params[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>模式三：动态下发与分包</strong></p>\n<p>将非核心代码打入独立的动态库/Bundle，启动时不加载。首次使用时动态 dlopen 或从网络下载加载：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>iOS</th>\n<th>Android</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>动态库</td>\n<td>dlopen 私有 Framework</td>\n<td>DexClassLoader 加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源分包</td>\n<td>On-Demand Resources</td>\n<td>Android App Bundle + Play Feature Delivery</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热修复</td>\n<td>JSPatch（已下架）/ 自研</td>\n<td>Tinker / Sophix</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"首次惩罚与预加载\">首次惩罚与预加载</h3><p>延迟初始化的副作用是「首次使用惩罚」——用户第一次触发功能时可能有额外加载延迟。解决策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>预热（Warm-up）</strong>：在用户高概率路径之前提前预加载。例如首页出现直播入口时提前初始化直播 SDK。</li>\n<li><strong>渐进加载</strong>：先展示占位 UI，后台完成初始化后再刷新真实内容。</li>\n<li><strong>预测性加载</strong>：基于用户行为模型预测下一步操作，提前加载对应模块。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"实践案例\">实践案例</h2><p>某社交 App 启动任务编排优化：</p>\n<p><strong>治理前状态</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Application.onCreate 中同步初始化 23 个 SDK</li>\n<li>启动耗时 P50 = 3.1s，其中 Application.onCreate 占 1.4s</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>治理步骤</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>梳理 23 个 SDK 的依赖关系，绘制 DAG 图</li>\n<li>分级：P0 = 3 个，P1 = 5 个，P2 = 9 个，P3 = 6 个</li>\n<li>P0 保持同步，P1 并行执行（4 线程），P2 注册 IdleHandler，P3 注册路由懒加载</li>\n<li>为 P3 模块增加预加载策略——在用户滑动到对应入口时触发</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>治理后效果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Application.onCreate 耗时从 1.4s 降至 380ms</li>\n<li>启动耗时 P50 = 1.7s（降幅 45%）</li>\n<li>P3 模块首次打开延迟 &lt; 200ms（用户无感知）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>延迟初始化的本质是「把正确的事放在正确的时机做」。通过任务分级（P0-P3）、依赖关系分析（DAG 拓扑排序）、编排框架（并行 + idle + 路由触发）三层设计，可以系统化地缩减启动关键路径。需要注意首次惩罚问题，通过预热和预测性加载来平衡启动速度与功能可用性。下一节将讲解如何建立启动指标体系，持续监控这些优化成果不发生劣化。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"延迟初始化与按需加载","id":"延迟初始化与按需加载"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"启动任务分级模型","id":"启动任务分级模型"},{"level":3,"text":"任务编排框架设计","id":"任务编排框架设计"},{"level":3,"text":"延迟加载的具体模式","id":"延迟加载的具体模式"},{"level":3,"text":"首次惩罚与预加载","id":"首次惩罚与预加载"},{"level":2,"text":"实践案例","id":"实践案例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"冷启动耗时分析与优化策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/startup-optimization/cold-start-analysis"},"next":{"title":"启动指标体系与监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/startup-optimization/startup-metrics-monitoring"}}